{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>NordicScribe 可把 iPhone 變成私人會議錄音工具，適合會議、客戶諮詢、課堂與口述記錄，支援以 iPhone 麥克風或 AirPods 收音，原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-212.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線會議紀錄與摘要</h2>\n<p>它會建立附時間戳的文字稿，並可一鍵整理成結構化會議紀錄；內置摘要、客戶諮詢、SOAP 記錄、課堂筆記與口述清理等範本，亦可用自訂指示處理內容。轉錄與 AI 分析在裝置端運行，無伺服器、無帳戶，支援日曆標題與參與者、鎖屏持續錄音，並可匯出 PDF、Markdown 或純文字。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-241-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-242-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-243-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-244-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-245-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-246-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：NordicScribe: Meeting Recorder</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/nordicscribe-meeting-recorder/id6824518120?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:24:04.120148+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:01:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:37:12.742575+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:17:25.499542+00:00","content_hash":"a636a58e40a4e1ba4fa13e3a050b532a687a9e492892bee4e8fabff6ed27f8d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:24:04.120148+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}